# Every text file is stored with LF line ends and checked out with LF, on the
# desktop (Windows) and in the cloud (Linux) alike, whatever core.autocrlf
# says (the editor, 2026-10-19; docs/WORKING_NOTES.md, "Line ends"). Before
# this the repository held both kinds, and Git for Windows turned LF into
# CRLF on the desktop only.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.xlsx binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary

# The hook scripts are run by sh and Python on Windows and Linux alike.
.claude/hooks/* text eol=lf
